# Pinned release inputs. Shell-sourceable KEY=VALUE only (no spaces, no quoting).
# The pipeline fails closed when any of these does not match what it fetched or built.
# Provenance of each hash: see release/PIPELINE.md ("Pinned inputs").

# --- builder and smoke images -----------------------------------------------------------
# ubuntu:22.04 OCI index digest (linux/amd64 is resolved from it); apt reads this dated snapshot.
